  abilityDesc: 16 combo powerful Earth attack on all foes, enormously boosts BB gauge
    for 5 turns, removes all status ailments and Atk, Def, Rec reduction effects,
    negates all status ailments and Atk, Def, Rec reduction effects for 5 turns &
    adds probable 1 turn Atk, Def reduction effects to attack for 5 turns
